                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Awarding agency = the DHS component and office that signed the contract action, not the agency that funded it. Expand a component to see its offices. YoY % is blank where prior-year net obligations are not positive. Competed and small business shares are blank where net obligations are not positive, or where the share would fall outside 0-100% because de-obligations on older awards outweigh new obligations in that category.'"
